do_4 = "Use the focused documentation grep to assert the corrected statements about modes, unhealthy status, unconditional routes, policy unavailability, audited authorization and non-destructive drain, and reject each obsolete claim from contracts/services.md:68; preserve all runtime behavior and existing tests."
